n: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.50.6055<br/>December 5, 2017<br/>Winter Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Last Sanctum</b> is the hiding place of some were-beasts. Rumors say they are using this place to cast magic that helps them spreading the were-sickness. It's somehow connected to Ley Lines. \n</p><p>When entering the Last Sanctum, you will see this message:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">In the Moonshadow Temple you proved to be worthy. As you enter each wall mirror shows the reflection of a different were-beast.</span></dd></dl>\n<p>In order to enter this place you must perform the ritual inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimvale\">Grimvale</a>'s Moonshadow Temple. Check the Grimvale Quest - The Curse Spreads for details.\n</p><p>After finishing the Grimvale Quest - The Curse Spreads, you can use the death portal to travel between this place and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Lycanthropes%20Cave\">Edron Lycanthropes Cave</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Werefox\"><img alt=\"Werefox\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werefox_ea8e66.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Werefox\">Werefox</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-85× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Fox Paw (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Werefox Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Moonlight Crystals (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Star</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Bangle\">Emerald Bangle</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Rod\">Moonlight Rod</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Enchanted%20Emerald\">Small Enchanted Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a 